    # mm^4, c = 60): M = w*a*(2L-a)/8 = 3,200,000 N*mm -> sigma = M*c/I = 51.12
    # MPa; delta = w*a*(8L^3-4a^2L+a^3)/(384EI) = 1.64722 mm at mid-span
    # (verified against a numeric double-integration of the beam ODE).
